WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.700
The days which one cannot return to…

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.470
Soujyu was there, Rentarou was there. Days with just the three of us.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.490
I know I can’t go back,
but I still wish I could.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.110
Ever since we met Rentarou,
Soujyu and I have been happy.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:25.160
We were we, without being us.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.220
The one who would save such people…

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:34.360
I remember the days of
just the three of us…

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.700
Waking up in the morning, saying “Good morning,”

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.180
setting the table together, saying “Have a good meal.”

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.000
Right.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:51.810
What I remember is that sort of setting: days that were just ordinary days.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.500
Soujyu was there, Rentarou was there,

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.000
The days of the three of us.

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:03.810
We were happy.

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.050
If…

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:12.010
If I hadn’t met Rentarou,
what would have become of us?

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:16.490
If I hadn’t met Rentarou…

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:18.720
If…

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:20.750
There are no ifs…

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.940
since we did meet!

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:57.600
America, Europe, Asia, Africa.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.680
Isn’t that a line-up of the entire world’s arms brokers?

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.940
That sure is a line-up!

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:04.700
And so…

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:07.970
they’ve all gathered to make an industrial alliance out of a wedding, huh?

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:09.750
That’s right.

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.590
How shameless.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:16.550
They’ve underestimated the ICPO, haven’t they.

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:17.950
Haven’t they?

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:25.300
The police forces are to remain on standby.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.970
Please continue the surveillance of Wadatsumi Castle.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:33.020
Please continue your surveillance of the wedding ceremony.

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:42.720
It’s nearly time.

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:16.800
Welcome everyone,

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:21.140
to Mitsugi Kimihiko and Shirogane Sara’s wedding ceremony!

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:22.640
In Deutschland!

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.700
The match of the century.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:27.450
It’s as if they were born for this ultimate establishment,

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:29.640
a biologically perfect couple.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:33.350
And today, in this place and in this ceremony,

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.440
the ring which will bind the two of them together by oath.

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:36.900
Ika-su!

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:40.000
At the moment when the two of them are officially bonded,

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:43.800
their souls will be absorbed by the Ikaros wedding ring.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.910
It’ll lead the Ikaros series to its final completion.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.580
Nuclear weapons are a thing of the past.

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:53.250
The environmentally friendly Ikaros series.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:54.920
The bidding will start at 10 million yen!

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:55.900
30 million!

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:56.450
40 million!

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:57.400
55 million!

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:58.200
60 million!

00:03:58.200 --> 00:03:59.100
70 million!

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:04.250
Mitsugi Kimihiko.

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:05.350
Yes.

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:09.350
In times of sickness and health,

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:12.600
in times of happiness and sadness,

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:16.250
for richer or poorer,
do you swear to love her,

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:17.940
honor her,

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.450
comfort her,

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:20.850
help her,

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:25.130
and to sincerely devote yourself to her for as long as you shall live?

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:30.250
The ceremony in Germany,

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:32.100
the industrial union,
the personal selection,

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.790
and this wedding as well…

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:37.670
Everything is proceeding according to my father’s will.

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:41.400
It is not love that binds us.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:43.830
That’s why you are crying.

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:46.050
Isn’t it?

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:54.060
You may not believe me even when I say this, but…

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:58.320
I… like you.

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:03.750
Honestly speaking, I couldn’t call it love at the moment,

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:09.340
and I certainly think that it’s inadequate to justify this absurd wedding.

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:12.430
But you know, Sara,

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:16.050
I respect your kindness
in protecting Soujyu,

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:19.920
and your strength in
accepting your fate.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:24.950
And I think it will grow to become love over time.

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:26.930
That’s what I believe.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:28.850
Kimihiko-san…

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:34.900
I will make you happy.

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:39.020
I will swear this to God at the wedding ceremony today.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:41.950
I do.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:48.900
Shirogane Sara.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:55.790
Do you swear to sincerely devote yourself to him for as long as you shall live?

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:11.280
I do.

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.280
No matter what, huh?

00:06:33.900 --> 00:06:34.790
Of course.

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:43.800
Everything has been
in preparation for this…

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:52.620
For the sake of the Ika Fire manufacturing facility.

00:06:53.900 --> 00:06:56.470
We do understand everyone’s feelings,

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:01.350
but the edict is official and recognized by the courts.

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:05.780
The sashes on the protestors say “anti-redevelopment.”

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:05.300
It is already past the time for all of you to leave.

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:09.850
At this rate, you people of the Nikotama shopping district,

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:14.100
all of you who are participating in this rally…

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.830
it will be compulsory…

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:19.550
Kinoshita.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.400
Change over.

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.300
Hey! Gimme!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:27.180
Dammit!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.900
It can’t be helped.

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:34.700
There’s nothing we can do.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.760
Hey, Let’s begin.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.000
Just relax.

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:44.690
Our bulldozers are excellent.

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:48.200
No matter what your residents do,

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:51.030
in the twinkling of an eye, we’ll have them taken care of.

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:55.050
Though it may be a bit extreme,

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:58.040
consider yourself fortunate that you were able to join in the Ikaros Project.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:08.800
That’s enough.

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:13.450
They’re all Kumicho’s people.

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.750
There’s no way that
we can just beat them up.

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:18.900
You’ve all done well up to now.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:20.310
It’s about time to stop.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:25.800
I’m glad to have met you guys!

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:29.860
Even if this shopping district disappears, and everyone is scattered.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:38.180
We will always be a family. Always!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:42.370
Right? Hey, isn’t that right?

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.620
Please take care of Billy.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:50.300
Gen-san.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:54.300
Because I love it…

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.020
Because I love it…

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:07.900
BECAUSE I LOVE OUR NIKOTAMA!

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:16.510
There’s no way I can do this.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.410
I don’t want to do this either…

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:20.910
What?

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:31.340
What the hell is that?!

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:42.850
Well then, please exchange the rings.

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:05.970
It won’t last much longer!

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.380
We should be there soon…

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:13.050
I can see it!

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:14.350
I can see it, Rentarou!

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:19.700
Hold on tight!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:20.350
Okay!

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:50.350
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:10.400
Rentarou…

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:11.190
Soujyu…

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:14.650
Sorry for being late.

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:20.650
It doesn’t look like you came to congratulate me.

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:23.550
Yeah, I know.

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:28.120
No matter what anyone says, it’s gotta be the three of us.

00:11:30.300 --> 00:11:31.590
Rentarou.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.340
Gotta be the three of us, Sara-chan!

00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:37.060
Soujyu.

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:39.500
Kimihiko-san.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:43.380
This wedding ceremony being in your father’s will is absolute nonsense.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:47.100
The Wadatsumi group is pulling the strings and planning all of this.

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:50.000
They are a secret society that controls the underworld

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:54.550
and combines humans and squids to make immortal monsters!

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:56.690
Rentarou?

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:00.700
No, I’m serious.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:02.700
This is the proof!

00:12:04.350 --> 00:12:06.700
Of all things… Niko Spa…?

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:09.600
What?!

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:14.200
Rentarou!

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.130
Soujyu!

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:15.950
Sara!

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:16.650
Sara-chan!

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.700
Soujyu, let’s go up!

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:19.300
Yes!

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:20.550
I won’t let you!

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.350
It came back to life!

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:29.200
No.

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:30.600
It’s another one.

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:37.250
I promised that I would beat this regenerating monster…

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.700
This isn’t enough to take care of so many opponents.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:49.600
Open!

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:51.000
Open!

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:52.620
Open!!

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:56.170
Over here’s no good.

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:03.000
Kimihiko-san.

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:07.000
Wadatsumi is indeed one of our company groups.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:10.180
Of course, the Wadatsumi that I knew of was just an ordinary company.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:13.000
Just what is with this absurd event?

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:14.560
Regardless,

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.440
I promised that I’d make you happy.

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:21.700
Let’s go.

00:13:44.450 --> 00:13:46.800
Hey Yakuza, do something!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.400
That’s my line, policeman!

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:51.430
Th-This looks bad!

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:53.000
Michiru-san!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.300
What the?

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:56.700
I’ve been in love with you for a long…

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:59.500
Idiot! This isn’t the time to say that!

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:03.050
Since we’re gonna die anyway,
I at least want to confess my feelings!

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:05.450
How about being my bride in my next life?

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:13.900
Th-That is..

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:15.960
Is that for real?

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:23.650
Ainosuke…

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:27.180
Back then when you cut off this hand of mine and forgave me,

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:33.680
it might have been so I could protect this shopping district on this day, at this moment.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.450
Young commander.

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:36.350
Yeah!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:39.500
The Wadatsumi is
our enemy from now on.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:42.050
Therefore, the Sakurazuki group is now dissolved.

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:44.300
You are all free of your obligations…

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:45.300
YOU DAMN FOOL!

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:49.700
The Sakurazuki mansion is our house!

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.530
We live together
with you and the ladies!

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:56.450
Really, don’t say such
annoying things! Really!

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:58.890
COME ON!

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:08.500
Young commander.

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:09.450
Yeah!

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:14.400
Everyone it the entire group will pitch in
to clean up this mountain!

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:15.890
Kumichou!

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:17.400
Us too!

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:19.400
We won’t lose!

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:20.650
Senpai?

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:21.310
Hell yeah!

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:22.730
Because we love it!

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.950
Because we love this Nikotama!

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:29.200
Because we love this Nikotama!!

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:51.970
Soujyu!

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:53.180
Here!

00:16:06.050 --> 00:16:07.000
Rentarou!

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:20.500
Rentarou!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.250
We’re gonna take Sara back with us, right?

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:25.630
Yeah!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:31.640
Wait!

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:35.850
Enter Gothiloli Mask!

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:40.190
The expected confrontation has finally come!

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:41.320
You fools!

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.800
This is our problem!

00:16:43.800 --> 00:16:45.070
You shouldn’t get involved…

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:50.150
Is there a problem, stupid boss?

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:51.780
You…!

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.370
Everyone admires you even though

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:55.950
you foolishly throw all of your energy into the things you do.

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:56.850
Shimajima-san!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.600
Let’s do it, Yura-chan!

00:16:59.600 --> 00:17:01.350
Shall we do it, Kira-chan?

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:08.090
Now, go!

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.500
Go, Detective!

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:13.900
Excuse us!

00:17:29.320 --> 00:17:31.240
Don’t worry, everyone.

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:34.120
This is still all going according to plan.

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:36.000
Here’s a self-destruct mechanism to destroy the evidence!

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:38.700
This is a superb device which can cause great damage to the vicinity.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:41.330
First let’s start the bidding at five million!

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:55.380
Ika!

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:07.270
Kimihiko-san!

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:15.990
Thank you very much for your purchase of the Wadatsumi self-destruct mechanism.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.320
Ika-su!

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:21.250
Now, please bear witness to its power!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:28.150
Chief!

00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:29.500
Not yet!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.000
We need to wait!

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.300
It’s too easy.

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:33.450
There may be something still.

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:35.180
Something…

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:56.330
Sa…ra-chan.

00:18:57.800 --> 00:18:58.550
Soujyu!

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:00.810
Sara-chan is above us, Rentarou!

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:02.900
It’s that direction!

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:08.100
That direction… Does it even lead there?

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:12.130
Then again, they’re always aware of each other. They’re twins, after all!

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:14.420
Kimihiko-san!

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:17.920
Are you all right, Kimihiko-san?

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:22.930
Let’s go.

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:39.350
Soujyu!

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:40.660
Are you sure she’s up there?

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:44.900
Yes!

00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:51.770
I’m sorry!

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.100
Soujyu!

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:03.180
Especially in difficult times, think of fun things!

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:04.470
Like what?

00:20:05.000 --> 00:20:08.050
When the three of us return to Nikotama, what’s the first thing that we should do?

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:11.100
Uh… First of all, we’re gonna rest!

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.060
And then?

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:14.150
We’ll have a meal!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:15.050
And then?

00:20:15.050 --> 00:20:16.350
We’ll make some tea!

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:17.350
And then?

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:19.280
We’ll do whatever work we get!

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.320
And then?

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:22.650
We’ll do more and more work!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:23.870
That’s amazing!

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:27.350
More and more and more, we’ll do our work,

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:29.330
During holidays, we’ll go out!

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:40.510
It seems that this wedding was a huge mistake.

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:42.910
You go back to those two.

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:48.670
Kimihiko-san!

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:53.150
This castle is finished.

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:54.680
Quickly, go back to them.

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:57.360
I can’t, by myself…

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:59.150
Go, Sara.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.500
SARA!

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:19.500
Sara!

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.650
Rentarou!

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:29.720
SARA-CHAN!

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:29.720
Sara!

00:21:32.150 --> 00:21:33.000
Soujyu!

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.650
Go back to where we were just now.

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:36.360
No! We’ll go together!

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:37.100
Soujyu!

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:39.610
Yes…

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:48.300
Rentarou?

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.900
Keep it secret from Sara, okay?

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:05.760
She’s scary when she’s angry.

00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:07.900
We’ll meet later.

00:22:08.770 --> 00:22:10.450
Next time we meet,
there’ll be three of us!

00:22:11.150 --> 00:22:13.080
RENTAROU!

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:29.560
Inside my memories,

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:29.560
kioku no naka ni aru

00:22:29.920 --> 00:22:35.700
there was a happy moment

00:22:29.920 --> 00:22:35.700
shiawase na shunkan

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:41.670
within the light.

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:42.210
hikari no naka de ita

00:22:41.970 --> 00:22:48.310
It overflowed in this place.

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:48.310
afureteta kono basho de

00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:51.710
For example, 3 years later,

00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:52.280
tatoeba sen nen go

00:22:52.150 --> 00:22:55.920
would you be able

00:22:52.280 --> 00:22:56.500
bokura no jikan wo

00:22:56.050 --> 00:23:02.320
to remember our time?

00:22:56.500 --> 00:23:03.030
omoida ni suru koto dekiru ka na

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:07.160
Ah... the days gone by

00:23:03.030 --> 00:23:08.370
aa owatta hibi ga

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:15.670
always wrench my heart.

00:23:08.370 --> 00:23:16.280
KOKORO no zutto zutto shimetsuketeku

00:23:15.970 --> 00:23:20.740
Hey, more than before,

00:23:16.280 --> 00:23:21.690
nee mae yori motto

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:28.420
understand the feelings of love.

00:23:21.690 --> 00:23:29.300
itoshiku omou kimochi wo shitte

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:35.320
I won’t say goodbye. Always from now on,

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:35.960
sayonara wa iwanai yo zutto kore kara mo

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:39.960
the days of no return

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:40.870
modoru koto no nai hibi

00:23:40.620 --> 00:23:47.170
will leave your heart behind.

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:47.170
kokoro wo nokoshite

